# Everything CI installs for tests: run.in plus test tools, LinkML, a local S3 API, Arrow (publication forms),
# pySHACL (the independent validator of the SHACL shapes) and the ODCS standard's own JSON Schema and model
# (the oracle of the ODCS contract), both for edge/plugins/connectors, and cryptography (Ed25519) for the credential in
# port (edge/plugins/credential-in); and the linters of scripts/lint.sh (ruff, shellcheck, basedpyright with the Node
# it runs on).
-e ./admission
-e ./canon[test]
-e ./compiler[test,batch]
-e ./checker[test,contracts]
-e ./edge/publisher[test,s3]
